WEBVTT

00:04:57.716 --> 00:05:02.316
could help us today
to address the stubborn

00:05:02.356 --> 00:05:06.476
and seemingly persistent
developmental challenges

00:05:06.516 --> 00:05:09.716
that the continent faces today.

00:05:12.836 --> 00:05:16.396
This is not just about decarbonization.

00:05:17.156 --> 00:05:20.596
This is also about
development with dignity.

00:05:22.556 --> 00:05:24.676
This is about equity.

00:05:24.716 --> 00:05:27.996
It is about justice,
and it is about transparency.